      "op": "declareUnresolved",
      "subject": "Timer segments",
      "question": "The vocabulary has no state data, so the segment list (each segment a start and an optional open end; pause closes the open segment, resume opens a new one, stop closes any open segment) cannot be expressed in the plan. It is kept by the handwritten host/adapter code and must be verified independently (VER-TIMER-COMPLETION).",
