    {
      "op": "declareUnresolved",
      "subject": "Zero minute stop",
      "question": "When elapsed time rounds to zero whole minutes, should Stop still return to NoTimer and request no entry (state-model reading), or be refused (code reading, TIMER_TOO_SHORT)? The related under-thirty-seconds requirement is an open conflict outside this cohort (CONFLICT-TIMER-SHORT-STOP). The generated workflow always allows Stop to NoTimer; the handwritten completion reports nothing to record.",
